{"meta":{"format_version":"4.10","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"carcass_wolf","model_identifier":"carcass_wolf","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# carcass_wolf\n\nWolf carcass\n\n- Baked from `wolf.bbmodel`: the final (held) frame of its `death` clip, frozen into the groups' rest rotations so it needs no animation.\n- Same texture and UV layout as the source animal (its variant textures also fit).\n- Hit box / interaction: workers butcher it from the side; use the lying body's footprint (see bounds in Blockbench).\n- When butchered out, replace with `carcass_bones`.\n"},"description":"# carcass_wolf\n\nWolf carcass\n\n- Baked from `wolf.bbmodel`: the final (held) frame of its `death` clip, frozen into the groups' rest rotations so it needs no animation.\n- Same texture and UV layout as the source animal (its variant textures also fit).\n- Hit box / interaction: workers butcher it from the side; use the lying body's footprint (see bounds in Blockbench).\n- When butchered out, replace with `carcass_bones`.\n","resolution":{"width":64,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"chest","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-4.0,20.877,-14.0],"to":[4.0,32.377,-4.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"origin":[0.0,27.377,0.0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[40,14,48.0,25.5],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[20,14,30.0,25.5],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[48,14,56.0,25.5],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[30,14,40.0,25.5],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[15,27,23.0,37.0],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[23,27,31.0,37.0],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"86a76edb-8e27-5d5a-a855-0c5257a005a7"},{"name":"belly","box_uv":false,"rescale":false,"locked":false,"light_emission":0,"render_order":"default","allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.5,22.877,-5.0],"to":[3.5,31.377,9.0],"autouv":0,"color":0,"inflate":0.0,"